  m_text: 'The lightest weight belongs on the top leftmost plate when facing the
    exit.


    The heaviest weight is directly opposite it.


    The 3 kg weight
    is next to the lightest, on the same row.


    The 5 kg weight faces the 3 kg
    weight.


    The 2 kg weight is next to the 5 kg weight, but not next to the
    heaviest.'
